Some people read the newsgroup over a slow dialup connection. They don't 
want binaries hitting their time and phone bill.

Many news servers are configured to carry only the non-binary newsgroups. 
If a text newsgroup regularly starts receiving binary postings the server 
administrator may consider it easier just to drop the newsgroup instead of 
configuring it to cancel binaries.

A lot of servers will simply cancel binary postings which they see on text 
newsgroups.

